  <text><body>
    <div type="poem" xml:id="song" n="L16135">
      <head>Song</head>
      <idno type="URN">urn:laurel:eng:cutts.obev-john-cutts-lord-cutts.pg66619:song</idno><idno type="laurel-id">L16135</idno><note type="metre">trochaic tetrameter</note>
      <lg type="stanza" n="1" rhyme="abaaba">
        <l n="1" real="+-xxxxx" met="+-+-+-+">Only tell her that I love:</l>
        <l n="2" real="xxxxxxx" met="+-+-+-+">Leave the rest to her and Fate:</l>
        <l n="3" real="xx+-xxx" met="+-+-+-+">Some kind planet from above</l>
        <l n="4" real="x-+x+-x" met="+-+-+-+">May perhaps her pity move:</l>
        <l n="5" real="+-xxxxx" met="+-+-+-+">Lovers on their stars must wait.--</l>
        <l n="6" real="+-xxxxx" met="+-+-+-+">Only tell her that I love!</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="stanza" n="2" rhyme="abccba">
        <l n="7" real="xxxxx-+" met="+-+-+-+">Why, O why should I despair!</l>
        <l n="8" real="+-+-xxx" met="+-+-+-+">Mercy’s pictured in her eye:</l>
        <l n="9" real="xxx-+xx" met="+-+-+-+">If she once vouchsafe to hear,</l>
        <l n="10" real="+-xxx+x" met="+-+-+-+">Welcome Hope and farewell Fear!</l>
        <l n="11" real="xxxxxxx" met="+-+-+-+">She’s too good to let me die.--</l>
        <l n="12" real="xxxxx-+" met="+-+-+-+">Why, O why should I despair?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body></text>
